<git-flow-rules>
# Git Flow Rules

## Nhanh chinh
- `develop` la nhanh chinh cho tat ca code moi trong giai doan phat trien.
- Neu repository chua co `develop`, tao `develop` tu `master`.
- Khong phat trien truc tiep tren `master`.
- `master` chi nhan code da on dinh, da review va da kiem thu tu `develop`.

## Nhanh tinh nang
- Moi task moi phai duoc lam tren mot feature branch tach tu `develop`.
- Ten nhanh dung dang `feature/ten-task`, viet ngan gon, ro nghia, uu tien kebab-case.
- Vi du:
  ```bash
  git checkout develop
  git pull
  git checkout -b feature/ten-task develop
  ```

## Dong bo truoc khi code hoac push
- Truoc khi bat dau code, cap nhat `develop` moi nhat.
- Truoc khi push feature branch, merge code moi nhat tu `develop` de giam xung dot.
- Quy trinh chuan:
  ```bash
  git checkout develop
  git pull
  git checkout feature/ten-task
  git merge develop
  ```

## Pull Request / Merge Request
- Sau khi hoan thanh task, push feature branch len remote.
- Tao Pull Request hoac Merge Request tu feature branch vao `develop`.
- Gan reviewer theo yeu cau cua team, bao gom nguoi phu trach review/merge.
- Chi merge vao `develop` sau khi da duoc review va CI pass neu co.

## Khong merge truc tiep vao master
- Khong tao Pull Request tu feature branch vao `master`.
- Khong merge truc tiep code moi vao `master`.
- Viec dua code tu `develop` sang `master` chi thuc hien khi release on dinh va theo quy trinh rieng cua team.

## Quy uoc nhanh
- `develop`: code base chinh cho giai doan phat trien.
- `feature/*`: nhanh lam task moi, tach tu `develop`, merge ve `develop`.
- `master`: nhanh on dinh, chi nhan code da qua review va kiem thu.
</git-flow-rules>
